# Site settings of one starry-digitizer host (deploy/deploy.sh). Copy to
# ~/.config/starry-digitizer/site.env (or point STARRY_DIGITIZER_SITE at
# another path) and keep it out of the repository. Read as data, never run as
# shell: KEY=value, a value is one word or "double-quoted", optionally
# followed by a # comment. Only these keys; each at most once.

# ---- required ----

# Production's web dir (www -> releases/<commit>-<build>/), served at
# /starry-digitizer/. Outside the deploying user's home (nginx must read it):
#   sudo install -d -o $USER -g $USER -m 755 <dir>
STARRY_DIGITIZER_WEB_DIR=/srv/starry-digitizer
# Staging's, served at /starry-digitizer-staging/. Never inside production's.
STARRY_DIGITIZER_STAGING_WEB_DIR=/srv/starry-digitizer-staging

# ---- optional ----

# The wpd-auto API the page calls, as the page sees it (same origin).
#STARRY_DIGITIZER_API_URL=/wpd-auto/api/v1
#STARRY_DIGITIZER_STAGING_API_URL=/wpd-auto-staging/api/v1

# Lock, build counter, deploy history.
#STARRY_DIGITIZER_APP_DIR=~/.local/share/starry-digitizer
